,\"choices\":[{\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":9,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"ebsco.com\",\"data\":\"His father was an astronomer named Phidias, which likely spurred his early interest in the cosmos and mathematics.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGdvLot8qUyW70d_FUFTYRv2oBcEGSIGNy56f3uTwXfyKai2jl3gyE-ed2sh1yRBQ8GBSM9ers_1d5bsia9laA_EWOvYjgxMEv9OH2GZU453ERXedp2_UOoYlPwJkEp5Oa5jh4nLgdlufMyk1hln22fnjj4RQ0=\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}},\"finish_reason\":null,\"index\":0}],\"created\":1784207954,\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"usage\":null}\n\ndata: {\"id\":\"d95e509c-2c2e-40d9-887f-3c53cc3fb38a\",\"choices\":[{\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":10,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"britannica.com\",\"data\":\"Some historical accounts suggest a familial relationship with King Hiero II of Syracuse, and Archimedes was certainly on intimate terms with the ruler.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFkFw1qTnXQ6Z7yaLbV968b_k0Jq9eBRjd8eEL-srv-bq6WF9h6GkznhZiF9oQRY8S3jeEiOT1tT2vkhFzKuYykBrXGsct16ux884ICzlyPJiCr5pKnuYoEZ7Cg1ruwye-1JaKh8Ipk1vt3\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}},\"finish_reason\":null,\"index\":0}],\"created\":1784207954,\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"usage\":null}\n\ndata: {\"id\":\"d95e509c-2c2e-40d9-887f-3c53cc3fb38a\",\"choices\":[{\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":11,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"ebsco.com\",\"data\":\"Some historical accounts suggest a familial relationship with King Hiero II of Syracuse, and Archimedes was certainly on intimate terms with the ruler.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGdvLot8qUyW70d_FUFTYRv2oBcEGSIGNy56f3uTwXfyKai2jl3gyE-ed2sh1yRBQ8GBSM9ers_1d5bsia9laA_EWOvYjgxMEv9OH2GZU453ERXedp2_UOoYlPwJkEp5Oa5jh4nLgdlufMyk1hln22fnjj4RQ0=\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}},\"finish_reason\":null,\"index\":0}],\"created\":1784207954,\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"usage\":null}\n\ndata: {\"id\":\"d95e509c-2c2e-40d9-887f-3c53cc3fb38a\",\"choices\":[{\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":12,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"st-andrews.ac.uk\",\"data\":\"It is widely believed that Archimedes spent time in his youth studying in Alexandria, Egypt, the intellectual heart of the Hellenistic world.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGdI7sF8gy1OxcUGMGGx7BbkJUBwa-pULJ-wJPuk4EXVb9r85fObDyGiFIO0zwHd3i_ZhTbcR9KzbpvQn6gyT17BafTVFHRj9YkkwsLj3pZh7SODmW0C2qyujCnfc4VUBiC2v4Hu1sE5awdhtI6t54TwPDBs33MOIk=\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}},\"finish_reason\":null,\"index\":0}],\"created\":1784207954,\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"usage\":null}\n\ndata: {\"id\":\"d95e509c-2c2e-40d9-887f-3c53cc3fb38a\",\"choices\":[{\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":13,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"ebsco.com\",\"data\":\"It is widely believed that Archimedes spent time in his youth studying in Alexandria, Egypt, the intellectual heart of the Hellenistic world.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGdvLot8qUyW70d_FUFTYRv2oBcEGSIGNy56f3uTwXfyKai2jl3gyE-ed2sh1yRBQ8GBSM9ers_1d5bsia9laA_EWOvYjgxMEv9OH2GZU453ERXedp2_UOoYlPwJkEp5Oa5jh4nLgdlufMyk1hln22fnjj4RQ0=\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}},\"finish_reason\":null,\"index\":0}],\"created\":1784207954,\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"usage\":null}\n\ndata: {\"id\":\"d95e509c-2c2e-40d9-887f-3c53cc3fb38a\",\"choices\":[{\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":14,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"britannica.com\",\"data\":\"There, he would have studied with the successors of Euclid and interacted with prominent mathematicians of his time, like Conon of Samos and Eratosthenes of Cyrene, with whom he maintained correspondence throughout his life.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFkFw1qTnXQ6Z7yaLbV968b_k0Jq9eBRjd8eEL-srv-bq6WF9h6GkznhZiF9oQRY8S3jeEiOT1tT2vkhFzKuYykBrXGsct16ux884ICzlyPJiCr5pKnuYoEZ7Cg1ruwye-1JaKh8Ipk1vt3\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}},\"finish_reason\":null,\"index\":0}],\"created\":1784207954,\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"usage\":null}\n\ndata: {\"id\":\"d95e509c-2c2e-40d9-887f-3c53cc3fb38a\",\"choices\":[{\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":15,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"ebsco.com\",\"data\":\"There, he would have studied with the successors of Euclid and interacted with prominent mathematicians of his time, like Conon of Samos and Eratosthenes of Cyrene, with whom he maintained correspondence throughout his life.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGdvLot8qUyW70d_FUFTYRv2oBcEGSIGNy56f3uTwXfyKai2jl3gyE-ed2sh1yRBQ8GBSM9ers_1d5bsia9laA_EWOvYjgxMEv9OH2GZU453ERXedp2_UOoYlPwJkEp5Oa5jh4nLgdlufMyk1hln22fnjj4RQ0=\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}},\"finish_reason\":null,\"index\":0}],\"created\":1784207954,\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"usage\":null}\n\ndata: {\"id\":\"d95e509c-2c2e-40d9-887f-3c53cc3fb38a\",\"choices\":[{\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":16,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"st-andrews.ac.uk\",\"data\":\"Archimedes is regarded by many historians as one of the greatest mathematicians of all time, revolutionizing the field of geometry.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGdI7sF8gy1OxcUGMGGx7BbkJUBwa-pULJ-wJPuk4EXVb9r85fObDyGiFIO0zwHd3i_ZhTbcR9KzbpvQn6gyT17BafTVFHRj9YkkwsLj3pZh7SODmW0C2qyujCnfc4VUBiC2v4Hu1sE5awdhtI6t54TwPDBs33MOIk=\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}},\"finish_reason\":null,\"index\":0}],\"created\":1784207954,\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"usage\":null}\n\ndata: {\"id\":\"d95e509c-2c2e-40d9-887f-3c53cc3fb38a\",\"choices\":[{\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":17,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"wikipedia.org\",\"data\":\"He perfected a method of integration, a precursor to modern calculus, which allowed him to calculate areas and volumes of various geometric figures with remarkable precision.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGf8ICtbbbGPw3D4_9LfaJzxdnbwobIlLt5-edF3jdRqDPub1wsox4Xm1g0DDatrNtmQ8fMoECohGsY35_3cBExza9XUHWeMFZUv1kHetWK33W4BOjuF1UyENANCVWg5iwY6kg=\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}},\"finish_reason\":null,\"index\":0}],\"created\":1784207954,\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"usage\":null}\n\ndata: {\"id\":\"d95e509c-2c2e-40d9-887f-3c53cc3fb38a\",\"choices\":[{\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":18,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"st-andrews.ac.uk\",\"data\":\"He perfected a method of integration, a precursor to modern calculus, which allowed him to calculate areas and volumes of various geometric figures with remarkable precision.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGdI7sF8gy1OxcUGMGGx7BbkJUBwa-pULJ-wJPuk4EXVb9r85fObDyGiFIO0zwHd3i_ZhTbcR9KzbpvQn6gyT17BafTVFHRj9YkkwsLj3pZh7SODmW0C2qyujCnfc4VUBiC2v4Hu1sE5awdhtI6t54TwPDBs33MOIk=\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}},\"finish_reason\":null,\"index\":0}],\"created\":1784207954,\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"usage\":null}\n\ndata: {\"id\":\"d95e509c-2c2e-40d9-887f-3c53cc3fb38a\",\"choices\":[{\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":19,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"britannica.com\",\"data\":\"He was so proud of this discovery that he requested it be engraved on his tombstone.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFkFw1qTnXQ6Z7yaLbV968b_k0Jq9eBRjd8eEL-srv-bq6WF9h6GkznhZiF9oQRY8S3jeEiOT1tT2vkhFzKuYykBrXGsct16ux884ICzlyPJiCr5pKnuYoEZ7Cg1ruwye-1JaKh8Ipk1vt3\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}},\"finish_reason\":null,\"index\":0}],\"created\":1784207954,\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"usage\":null}\n\ndata: {\"id\":\"d95e509c-2c2e-40d9-887f-3c53cc3fb38a\",\"choices\":[{\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":20,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"mit.edu\",\"data\":\"He was so proud of this discovery that he requested it be engraved on his tombstone.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEV88rG0wX4nWTIzIAymG0_s_lvIcTawQV7Hq2faYp7vKsv7dOTMFZZNUlmamHJ0ELo3XZocBIEvMbfgj8p6pqkOFXwOe8Mwe6D2XGUrCk9KUDwdqwCREW5oOABTv107x6sH4dFMtzvsz5tByIK2C43X33j\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}},\"finish_reason\":null,\"index\":0}],\"created\":1784207954,\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"usage\":null}\n\ndata: {\"id\":\"d95e509c-2c2e-40d9-887f-3c53cc3fb38a\",\"choices\":[{\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":21,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"britannica.com\",\"data\":\"*   **Approximation of Pi (\u03c0):** In his treatise *Measurement of a Circle*, Archimedes calculated a remarkably accurate approximation of pi, showing it to be between 3 10/71 and 3 1/7.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFkFw1qTnXQ6Z7yaLbV968b_k0Jq9eBRjd8eEL-srv-bq6WF9h6GkznhZiF9oQRY8S3jeEiOT1tT2vkhFzKuYykBrXGsct16ux884ICzlyPJiCr5pKnuYoEZ7Cg1ruwye-1JaKh8Ipk1vt3\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}},\"finish_reason\":null,\"index\":0}],\"created\":1784207954,\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"usage\":null}\n\ndata: {\"id\":\"d95e509c-2c2e-40d9-887f-3c53cc3fb38a\",\"choices\":[{\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":22,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"elephantlearning.com\",\"data\":\"*   **Approximation of Pi (\u03c0):** In his treatise *Measurement of a Circle*, Archimedes calculated a remarkably accurate approximation of pi, showing it to be between 3 10/71 and 3 1/7.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQF9S4BfYSZBt55b4g5sCnBCubahXiiXkA49tkRkg9DGX5Gk7LpWqmPz_BGMyUZCteDEbp3W1j0c8BlgGbz0VUSGcDvbN95W_8trqG0deghHRz29HTYLI9-4kCJHMiPFjLOLwG0pTj1kSKl9WvW5-d8gdoIDg38l1JvIQ8PC4-QsLUq1YkzJ1_IcCIXAuWE=\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}},\"finish_reason\":null,\"index\":0}],\"created\":1784207954,\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"usage\":null}\n\ndata: {\"id\":\"d95e509c-2c2e-40d9-887f-3c53cc3fb38a\",\"choices\":[{\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":23,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"britannica.com\",\"data\":\"*   **Archimedes' Principle:** Perhaps his most famous discovery, this principle of hydrostatics states that a body immersed in a fluid is buoyed up by a force equal to the weight of the fluid it displaces.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFkFw1qTnXQ6Z7yaLbV968b_k0Jq9eBRjd8eEL-srv-bq6WF9h6GkznhZiF9oQRY8S3jeEiOT1tT2vkhFzKuYykBrXGsct16ux884ICzlyPJiCr5pKnuYoEZ7Cg1ruwye-1JaKh8Ipk1vt3\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}},\"finish_reason\":null,\"index\":0}],\"created\":1784207954,\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"usage\":null}\n\ndata: {\"id\":\"d95e509c-2c2e-40d9-887f-3c53cc3fb38a\",\"choices\":[{\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":24,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"britannica.com\",\"data\":\"The legendary tale recounts Archimedes making this discovery in his bath and running through the streets naked shouting \\\"Eureka!\\\" (\\\"I have found it!\\\").\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFkFw1qTnXQ6Z7yaLbV968b_k0Jq9eBRjd8eEL-srv-bq6WF9h6GkznhZiF9oQRY8S3jeEiOT1tT2vkhFzKuYykBrXGsct16ux884ICzlyPJiCr5pKnuYoEZ7Cg1ruwye-1JaKh8Ipk1vt3\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}},\"finish_reason\":null,\"index\":0}],\"created\":1784207954,\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"usage\":null}\n\ndata: {\"id\":\"d95e509c-2c2e-40d9-887f-3c53cc3fb38a\",\"choices\":[{\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":25,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"historyextra.com\",\"data\":\"This breakthrough allowed him to determine whether a crown made for King Hiero II was pure gold.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQH1Pnn2A0pXTUm1JgOFbi3mK_5Xf-lZvPKIW5p5_qF60yzxyeHOoQg9VB8y4Ys1xJqwFtimEA0eb4m-FU5ieChedMBfy6U1LsROIbgNf-VNt-ZsnHsIZ-NAasyU3bpz2yEXDZ7CjtgvUKjC9GW9F_U1V-3MPdWeK-8B6gXsTEK4cKxn24VpEWOgFIPaNvtL1y_ebBxeBCRDiR5s3k7P\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}},\"finish_reason\":null,\"index\":0}],\"created\":1784207954,\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"usage\":null}\n\ndata: {\"id\":\"d95e509c-2c2e-40d9-887f-3c53cc3fb38a\",\"choices\":[{\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":26,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"wikipedia.org\",\"data\":\"*   **Foundations of Statics and Hydrostatics:** He established the fundamental principles of mechanics, including the law of the lever, and extensively used the concept of the center of gravity.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGf8ICtbbbGPw3D4_9LfaJzxdnbwobIlLt5-edF3jdRqDPub1wsox4Xm1g0DDatrNtmQ8fMoECohGsY35_3cBExza9XUHWeMFZUv1kHetWK33W4BOjuF1UyENANCVWg5iwY6kg=\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}},\"finish_reason\":null,\"index\":0}],\"created\":1784207954,\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"usage\":null}\n\ndata: {\"id\":\"d95e509c-2c2e-40d9-887f-3c53cc3fb38a\",\"choices\":[{\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":27,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"st-andrews.ac.uk\",\"data\":\"*   **Foundations of Statics and Hydrostatics:** He established the fundamental principles of mechanics, including the law of the lever, and extensively used the concept of the center of gravity.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGdI7sF8gy1OxcUGMGGx7BbkJUBwa-pULJ-wJPuk4EXVb9r85fObDyGiFIO0zwHd3i_ZhTbcR9KzbpvQn6gyT17BafTVFHRj9YkkwsLj3pZh7SODmW0C2qyujCnfc4VUBiC2v4Hu1sE5awdhtI6t54TwPDBs33MOIk=\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}},\"finish_reason\":null,\"index\":0}],\"created\":1784207954,\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"usage\":null}\n\ndata: {\"id\":\"d95e509c-2c2e-40d9-887f-3c53cc3fb38a\",\"choices\":[{\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":28,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"st-andrews.ac.uk\",\"data\":\"While Archimedes may have considered his mathematical work to be his purest passion, his reputation in antiquity was greatly enhanced by his extraordinary inventions.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGdI7sF8gy1OxcUGMGGx7BbkJUBwa-pULJ-wJPuk4EXVb9r85fObDyGiFIO0zwHd3i_ZhTbcR9KzbpvQn6gyT17BafTVFHRj9YkkwsLj3pZh7SODmW0C2qyujCnfc4VUBiC2v4Hu1sE5awdhtI6t54TwPDBs33MOIk=\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}},\"finish_reason\":null,\"index\":0}],\"created\":1784207954,\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"usage\":null}\n\ndata: {\"id\":\"d95e509c-2c2e-40d9-887f-3c53cc3fb38a\",\"choices\":[{\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":29,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"britannica.com\",\"data\":\"Notable inventions and engineering projects attributed to him include:\\n*   **The Archimedes Screw:** This device, consisting of a screw rotating inside a cylinder, was used to raise water from a lower to a higher level.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFkFw1qTnXQ6Z7yaLbV968b_k0Jq9eBRjd8eEL-srv-bq6WF9h6GkznhZiF9oQRY8S3jeEiOT1tT2vkhFzKuYykBrXGsct16ux884ICzlyPJiCr5pKnuYoEZ7Cg1ruwye-1JaKh8Ipk1vt3\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}},\"finish_reason\":null,\"index\":0}],\"created\":1784207954,\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"usage\":null}\n\ndata: {\"id\":\"d95e509c-2c2e-40d9-887f-3c53cc3fb38a\",\"choices\":[{\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":30,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"mit.edu\",\"data\":\"Notable inventions and engineering projects attributed to him include:\\n*   **The Archimedes Screw:** This device, consisting of a screw rotating inside a cylinder, was used to raise water from a lower to a higher level.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEV88rG0wX4nWTIzIAymG0_s_lvIcTawQV7Hq2faYp7vKsv7dOTMFZZNUlmamHJ0ELo3XZocBIEvMbfgj8p6pqkOFXwOe8Mwe6D2XGUrCk9KUDwdqwCREW5oOABTv107x6sH4dFMtzvsz5tByIK2C43X33j\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}},\"finish_reason\":null,\"index\":0}],\"created\":1784207954,\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"usage\":null}\n\ndata: {\"id\":\"d95e509c-2c2e-40d9-887f-3c53cc3fb38a\",\"choices\":[{\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":31,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"mit.edu\",\"data\":\"It was employed for irrigation and draining ships, and variations are still used today.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEV88rG0wX4nWTIzIAymG0_s_lvIcTawQV7Hq2faYp7vKsv7dOTMFZZNUlmamHJ0ELo3XZocBIEvMbfgj8p6pqkOFXwOe8Mwe6D2XGUrCk9KUDwdqwCREW5oOABTv107x6sH4dFMtzvsz5tByIK2C43X33j\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}},\"finish_reason\":null,\"index\":0}],\"created\":1784207954,\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"usage\":null}\n\ndata: {\"id\":\"d95e509c-2c2e-40d9-887f-3c53cc3fb38a\",\"choices\":[{\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":32,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"wikipedia.org\",\"data\":\"He is credited with designing powerful catapults, compound pulleys, and the \\\"Claw of Archimedes,\\\" a crane-like device capable of lifting enemy ships out of the water.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGf8ICtbbbGPw3D4_9LfaJzxdnbwobIlLt5-edF3jdRqDPub1wsox4Xm1g0DDatrNtmQ8fMoECohGsY35_3cBExza9XUHWeMFZUv1kHetWK33W4BOjuF1UyENANCVWg5iwY6kg=\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}},\"finish_reason\":null,\"index\":0}],\"created\":1784207954,\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"usage\":null}\n\ndata: {\"id\":\"d95e509c-2c2e-40d9-887f-3c53cc3fb38a\",\"choices\":[{\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":33,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"mit.edu\",\"data\":\"He is credited with designing powerful catapults, compound pulleys, and the \\\"Claw of Archimedes,\\\" a crane-like device capable of lifting enemy ships out of the water.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEV88rG0wX4nWTIzIAymG0_s_lvIcTawQV7Hq2faYp7vKsv7dOTMFZZNUlmamHJ0ELo3XZocBIEvMbfgj8p6pqkOFXwOe8Mwe6D2XGUrCk9KUDwdqwCREW5oOABTv107x6sH4dFMtzvsz5tByIK2C43X33j\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}},\"finish_reason\":null,\"index\":0}],\"created\":1784207954,\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"usage\":null}\n\ndata: {\"id\":\"d95e509c-2c2e-40d9-887f-3c53cc3fb38a\",\"choices\":[{\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":34,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"historyextra.com\",\"data\":\"He is credited with designing powerful catapults, compound pulleys, and the \\\"Claw of Archimedes,\\\" a crane-like device capable of lifting enemy ships out of the water.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQH1Pnn2A0pXTUm1JgOFbi3mK_5Xf-lZvPKIW5p5_qF60yzxyeHOoQg9VB8y4Ys1xJqwFtimEA0eb4m-FU5ieChedMBfy6U1LsROIbgNf-VNt-ZsnHsIZ-NAasyU3bpz2yEXDZ7CjtgvUKjC9GW9F_U1V-3MPdWeK-8B6gXsTEK4cKxn24VpEWOgFIPaNvtL1y_ebBxeBCRDiR5s3k7P\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}},\"finish_reason\":null,\"index\":0}],\"created\":1784207954,\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"usage\":null}\n\ndata: {\"id\":\"d95e509c-2c2e-40d9-887f-3c53cc3fb38a\",\"choices\":[{\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":35,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"britannica.com\",\"data\":\"These machines were so effective they delayed the capture of the city.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFkFw1qTnXQ6Z7yaLbV968b_k0Jq9eBRjd8eEL-srv-bq6WF9h6GkznhZiF9oQRY8S3jeEiOT1tT2vkhFzKuYykBrXGsct16ux884ICzlyPJiCr5pKnuYoEZ7Cg1ruwye-1JaKh8Ipk1vt3\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}},\"finish_reason\":null,\"index\":0}],\"created\":1784207954,\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"usage\":null}\n\ndata: {\"id\":\"d95e509c-2c2e-40d9-887f-3c53cc3fb38a\",\"choices\":[{\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":36,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"historyextra.com\",\"data\":\"*   **The Odometer:** The Roman architect Vitruvius credited Archimedes with inventing the first odometer, a cart with a gear mechanism that would drop a pebble into a box after each mile traveled.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQH1Pnn2A0pXTUm1JgOFbi3mK_5Xf-lZvPKIW5p5_qF60yzxyeHOoQg9VB8y4Ys1xJqwFtimEA0eb4m-FU5ieChedMBfy6U1LsROIbgNf-VNt-ZsnHsIZ-NAasyU3bpz2yEXDZ7CjtgvUKjC9GW9F_U1V-3MPdWeK-8B6gXsTEK4cKxn24VpEWOgFIPaNvtL1y_ebBxeBCRDiR5s3k7P\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}},\"finish_reason\":null,\"index\":0}],\"created\":1784207954,\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"usage\":null}\n\ndata: {\"id\":\"d95e509c-2c2e-40d9-887f-3c53cc3fb38a\",\"choices\":[{\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":37,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"historyextra.com\",\"data\":\"*   **The Ship *Syracusia*:** On behalf of King Hiero II, Archimedes designed a massive ship, said to be the largest of its time, complete with a gymnasium, library, and temple.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQH1Pnn2A0pXTUm1JgOFbi3mK_5Xf-lZvPKIW5p5_qF60yzxyeHOoQg9VB8y4Ys1xJqwFtimEA0eb4m-FU5ieChedMBfy6U1LsROIbgNf-VNt-ZsnHsIZ-NAasyU3bpz2yEXDZ7CjtgvUKjC9GW9F_U1V-3MPdWeK-8B6gXsTEK4cKxn24VpEWOgFIPaNvtL1y_ebBxeBCRDiR5s3k7P\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}},\"finish_reason\":null,\"index\":0}],\"created\":1784207954,\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"usage\":null}\n\ndata: {\"id\":\"d95e509c-2c2e-40d9-887f-3c53cc3fb38a\",\"choices\":[{\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":38,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"britannica.com\",\"data\":\"Archimedes died in 212 or 211 BCE during the sack of Syracuse by the Romans at the end of a long siege.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFkFw1qTnXQ6Z7yaLbV968b_k0Jq9eBRjd8eEL-srv-bq6WF9h6GkznhZiF9oQRY8S3jeEiOT1tT2vkhFzKuYykBrXGsct16ux884ICzlyPJiCr5pKnuYoEZ7Cg1ruwye-1JaKh8Ipk1vt3\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}},\"finish_reason\":null,\"index\":0}],\"created\":1784207954,\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"usage\":null}\n\ndata: {\"id\":\"d95e509c-2c2e-40d9-887f-3c53cc3fb38a\",\"choices\":[{\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":39,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"britannica.com\",\"data\":\"However, according to one popular account, a Roman soldier found Archimedes engrossed in a mathematical diagram and killed him when he refused to be disturbed.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFkFw1qTnXQ6Z7yaLbV968b_k0Jq9eBRjd8eEL-srv-bq6WF9h6GkznhZiF9oQRY8S3jeEiOT1tT2vkhFzKuYykBrXGsct16ux884ICzlyPJiCr5pKnuYoEZ7Cg1ruwye-1JaKh8Ipk1vt3\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}},\"finish_reason\":null,\"index\":0}],\"created\":1784207954,\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"usage\":null}\n\ndata: {\"id\":\"d95e509c-2c2e-40d9-887f-3c53cc3fb38a\",\"choices\":[{\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":40,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"britannica.com\",\"data\":\"Marcellus is said to have regretted his death and ensured he received a proper burial.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFkFw1qTnXQ6Z7yaLbV968b_k0Jq9eBRjd8eEL-srv-bq6WF9h6GkznhZiF9oQRY8S3jeEiOT1tT2vkhFzKuYykBrXGsct16ux884ICzlyPJiCr5pKnuYoEZ7Cg1ruwye-1JaKh8Ipk1vt3\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}},\"finish_reason\":null,\"index\":0}],\"created\":1784207954,\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"usage\":null}\n\ndata: {\"id\":\"d95e509c-2c2e-40d9-887f-3c53cc3fb38a\",\"choices\":[{\"delta\":{\"content\":\"\"},\"finish_reason\":null,\"index\":0}],\"created\":1784207954,\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"usage\":null}\n\ndata: {\"id\":\"d95e509c-2c2e-40d9-887f-3c53cc3fb38a\",\"choices\":[{\"delta\":{},\"finish_reason\":\"stop\",\"index\":0}],\"created\":1784207954,\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\",\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"usage\":{\"completion_tokens\":1121,\"prompt_tokens\":6,\"total_tokens\":1127}}\n\ndata: [DONE]\n\n",
